  m_Name: Bake Off
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 'Split into two teams and compete to make the best batch of cookies.
    You can make any kind of cookie you want (though it would be great if they were
    vegan). Please avoid using walnuts and pine nuts, since a few people have allergies.


    I
    have lots of basic ingredients, but if you need something else, Trader Joe''s
    closes at 9 and Fred Meyer closes at around 9:30. If you buy ingredients, let
    me know and I''ll reimburse you!


    You have 45 minutes to make your cookies,
    starting now. I (Sam) will judge your cookies when they''re done! All participants
    get one mark, and members of the winning team get two marks. Good luck!'
